<BaseLayout title="How We Prepare Shopkeeper Guides | Apna Galla" description="Our editorial approach to billing, khata, stock and shop hisaab guides: useful examples, AI assistance, accurate product limits and clear correction practices.">
<section class="section"><article class="container policy"><h1>Useful shopkeeper guides. Clear sources and limits.</h1><p>Apna Galla publishes practical explanations of billing, digital khata, stock, supplier dues and daily shop hisaab. We write in English with Hindi/Hinglish explanations so familiar questions lead to usable answers.</p><h2>Who prepares the content?</h2><p>Guides are published by Apna Galla with AI assistance. Product instructions are checked against our current application documentation and available workflows. We do not claim that an automated article has received an independent accountant's review.</p><h2>What belongs in a guide?</h2><p>A guide should answer a specific shopkeeper question, include an original worked example or checklist, and link to the relevant product workflow. Examples use illustrative people and amounts, never private customer records. Paid-plan requirements, unknown stock and missing costs must be described honestly.</p><h2>How do we handle changing facts?</h2><p>We consult current primary sources before stating rules or time-sensitive facts. Tax, filing and regulatory details need the appropriate official source; the software does not replace an applicable professional review. Publication dates describe actual publication. An updated date changes only after a substantive edit.</p><h2>Daily publishing and quality</h2><p>We aim to add one useful guide each day. A topic must add something to the existing library. We skip repeated keyword variations, unsupported claims, fabricated experience, invented statistics and articles that cannot pass our content and website checks.</p><h2>Corrections and contact</h2><p>Found a confusing example or product step? <a href="/contact/">Contact Apna Galla</a> with the guide URL and the part to review. Product availability and plan details are described on the <a href="/pricing/">Pricing page</a>.</p><p><a href="/blog/">Read the shopkeeper guides →</a></p></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.policy{max-width:52rem;line-height:1.9}.policy h1{font:800 clamp(1.9rem,4vw,3rem)/1.2 var(--ag-font-heading);margin-bottom:1.5rem}.policy h2{font:800 1.4rem var(--ag-font-heading);margin:2rem 0 1rem}.policy p{margin:1rem 0;color:var(--ag-text-secondary)}.policy a{color:var(--ag-primary);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}</style>
